components.look:
A full-width bar: --surface fill, 1px --divider bottom edge, min-height 3.5rem. Padding: --space-2 top and bottom, max(1rem, (100% - 70rem) / 2) at the sides. Flex, wrapping, justify-content space-between, align-items center, gap --space-2 vertical and --space-4 horizontal. The Brand is on the left. The nav on the right is a wrapping flex row with gap --space-2/--space-4, at --text-sm and min-width 0, holding:
- 'All reports' and 'Admin' as nav links: --text, weight 400, no underline;
- the Avatar (24px);
- '.who' ('Signed in as @login'): --text-muted, overflow-wrap anywhere, min-width 0;
- Sign out as a Quiet button.
Signed out, the nav holds 'All reports' and 'Sign in with GitHub' as a Primary button. .site-header form has margin 0.

ol.report-list: no bullets, padding 0, display grid, grid-template-columns repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 20rem), 1fr)), gap --space-4: three columns at 1280 and one at 375. Each .report-row is a Panel laid out as a flex column with gap --space-1:
- h2 at --text-lg 600, margin 0, wrapping anywhere, with the title link in --text and no underline;
- .numbers at --text-sm, --text, tabular-nums ('3 likes · 2 comments · 10 views');
- .published at --text-sm --text-muted, with margin-top auto so it sits at the card's foot.
